{"suttaId":"thag1.94","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[546,549],"vripara":"94"},"segments":{"thag1.94:0.4":"Mettajittheragāthā","thag1.94:1.1":"“Namo hi tassa bhagavato,","thag1.94:1.2":"sakyaputtassa sirīmato;","thag1.94:1.3":"Tenāyaṃ aggappattena,","thag1.94:1.4":"aggadhammo [aggo dhammo (sī.)] sudesito”ti. …","thag1.94:1.5":"Mettaji thero…. 5."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":2382,"to":2382,"paras":[{"para":2382,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag1.94:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>namo</b>ti namakkāro.","<b>Hī</b>ti nipātamattaṃ.","<b>Tassā</b>ti yo so bhagavā samattiṃsapāramiyo pūretvā sabbakilese bhañjitvā anuttaraṃ sammāsambodhiṃ abhisambuddho, sakyarājassa puttoti <b>sakyaputto</b>.","Anaññasādhāraṇāya puññasampattiyā ca sambhāvito uttamāya rūpakāyasiriyā dhammakāyasiriyā ca samannāgatattā <b>sirīmā,</b> tassa bhagavato sakyaputtassa sirīmato namo atthu, taṃ namāmīti attho.","<b>Tenā</b>ti tena bhagavatā.","<b>Aya</b>nti tassa dhammassa attano paccakkhatāya vadati.","<b>Aggappattenā</b>ti aggaṃ sabbaññutaṃ, sabbehi vā guṇehi aggabhāvaṃ seṭṭhabhāvaṃ pattena.","<b>Aggadhammo</b>ti aggo uttamo navavidhalokuttaro dhammo suṭṭhu aviparītaṃ <b>desito</b> paveditoti."],"lineRefs":[["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"],["thag1.94:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag1.94:1.1","namo",0,0],["thag1.94:1.1","hī",0,1],["thag1.94:1.1","sakyaputto",0,2],["thag1.94:1.1","tassā",0,2],["thag1.94:1.1","sirīmā",0,3],["thag1.94:1.3","tenā",0,4],["thag1.94:1.3","aggappattenā",0,6],["thag1.94:1.3","aggadhammo",0,7],["thag1.94:1.3","desito",0,7]],"before":[{"para":2365,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā"]},{"para":2366,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["<b>Namo</b> <b>hi tassa bhagavato</b>ti āyasmato mettajittherassa gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","So kira anomadassissa bhagavato kāle kulagehe nibbattitvā viññutaṃ patto sāsane abhippasanno hutvā bodhirukkhassa iṭṭhakāhi vedikaṃ cinitvā sudhāparikammaṃ kāresi.","Satthā tassa anumodanaṃ akāsi.","So tena puññakammena devaloke nibbattitvā aparāparaṃ puññāni katvā devamanussesu saṃsaranto imasmiṃ buddhuppāde magadharaṭṭhe aññatarassa brāhmaṇassa putto hutvā nibbatti, <b>mettajī</b>tissa nāmaṃ ahosi.","So vayappatto kāmesu ādīnavaṃ disvā tāpasapabbajjaṃ pabbajitvā araññe viharanto buddhuppādaṃ sutvā pubbahetunā codiyamāno satthu santikaṃ gantvā pavattinivattiyo ārabbha pañhaṃ pucchitvā satthārā pañhe vissajjite paṭiladdhasaddho pabbajitvā vipassanaṃ paṭṭhapetvā arahattaṃ pāpuṇi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 1.15.26-31) –"]},{"para":2367,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Anomadassīmunino, bodhivedimakāsahaṃ;"]},{"para":2368,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sudhāya piṇḍaṃ datvāna, pāṇikammaṃ akāsahaṃ."]},{"para":2369,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Disvā taṃ sukataṃ kammaṃ, anomadassī naruttamo;"]},{"para":2370,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Bhikkhusaṅghe ṭhito satthā, imā gāthā abhāsatha."]},{"para":2371,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Iminā sudhakammena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;"]},{"para":2372,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sampattiṃ anubhotvāna, dukkhassantaṃ karissati."]},{"para":2373,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Pasannamukhavaṇṇomhi, ekaggo susamāhito;"]},{"para":2374,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane."]},{"para":2375,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ito kappasate āsiṃ, paripuṇṇe anūnake;"]},{"para":2376,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Rājā sabbaghano nāma, cakkavattī mahabbalo."]},{"para":2377,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe… kataṃ buddhassa sāsana”nti."]},{"para":2378,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Arahattaṃ pana patvā satthāraṃ thomento – 94."]},{"para":2380,"vripara":"94","title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Namo hi tassa bhagavato, sakyaputtassa sirīmato;"]},{"para":2381,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tenāyaṃ aggappattena, aggadhammo sudesito”ti. –","gāthaṃ abhāsi;"]}],"after":[{"para":2383,"vripara":null,"title":"Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Mettajittheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 5."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
